WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.440
Ace became a top commander on a Yonko crew. Luffy&nbsp;
became a Yonko in just over two years. And Sabo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.660
rose to the position of commander in chief of&nbsp;
the revolutionary army with the sole purpose of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:17.700
taking down the world nobles. But what if instead&nbsp;
of seeking freedom from the world government, all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.520
three boys instead JOINED the marines TOGETHER in&nbsp;
order to make the world a better place that way?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.780
And this story simply must begin back&nbsp;
in the Goa Kingdom, where these three&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:32.460
boys grew up. Now from chapter one,&nbsp;
we know that Luffy was inspired to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:37.440
become a great pirate when he was saved from&nbsp;
certain death by his mentor Shanks. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.460
we also know that during this time,&nbsp;
Garp had been training Luffy - well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:46.800
if you can call throwing him into the jungle&nbsp;
or tying him to a balloon training - with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:53.040
specific purpose of turning him into a marine.&nbsp;
And we can assume he did something similar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:58.800
with Ace since he “raised” him as well. However,&nbsp;
both of them were dead set on becoming pirates.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:04.020
But for this scenario, let’s imagine that&nbsp;
something changed about their childhood.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:10.620
Maybe Garp was actually a good grandparent and&nbsp;
spent time with the boys, which made them want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:16.080
to follow in his footsteps. Or I think a more&nbsp;
likely situation could have been that the village&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:21.840
where Luffy grew up might have been attacked by&nbsp;
a ruthless band of pirates. And it is reasonable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:26.580
to assume that Shanks is out at sea so there is&nbsp;
no one to protect the village. We could even say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:32.100
that these pirates set fire to the forest on Mt.&nbsp;
Corvo, which would affect Ace also since he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:37.260
living up there with the mountain bandits. So with&nbsp;
the pirates running free, there is no hope for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:43.560
village until this marine admiral pulls up on&nbsp;
his chilly bicycle and casually wipes out the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:49.080
pirates. Which is a major turning point because&nbsp;
it shows Luffy and Ace exactly how important the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:55.020
Marines are to the world. And this single moment&nbsp;
ultimately inspires them to become Marines in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:59.580
the future. I also think the boys could have also&nbsp;
pretty easily convinced Sabo to join the Marines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:06.660
with them since Sabo already has a good heart and&nbsp;
wants to free people, which he can easily do as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:13.740
marine. Let’s just assume that he doesn’t sail&nbsp;
out to sea on his own and get himself blown up.

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:18.960
Now we don’t know for sure what&nbsp;
age people can join the Marines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:24.300
but we do know that this pink-haired&nbsp;
kid was sixteen when he joined,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:29.460
so let’s assume that older teenagers&nbsp;
can join. So just to keep things easy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:34.680
let’s say Ace and Sabo join when they are&nbsp;
seventeen, which is the same age that Ace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:40.500
originally set out to become a pirate. And if&nbsp;
these two are joining the Marines, there is no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:45.540
way Luffy is staying behind, so Garp is forced&nbsp;
to let the fourteen year old join as well.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.940
And as they begin their climb through the marine&nbsp;
ranks there are a few very important things to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:56.280
keep in mind. First, Luffy would probably still&nbsp;
have the straw hat. But a major question we will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.280 --> 00:03:02.880
answer later on is just how long Shanks will let&nbsp;
him keep it if he remains a marine. Also, you may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:08.520
have serious doubts about Luffy ever following&nbsp;
someone else’s orders, but this is where I should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:14.760
mention that their personalities would probably be&nbsp;
slightly changed. Luffy will still be adventurous,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:19.620
but if he knows he wants to be a marine, he would&nbsp;
probably eventually get used to the idea of taking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:25.980
orders. Also, Ace will still be hot headed and&nbsp;
Sabo will want to free people from oppression,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:30.780
just like they were in the original story. Plus,&nbsp;
even though they are supposed to follow orders,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:36.360
do you really think that is going to happen&nbsp;
all the time? *chuckle* We’ll see how long that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:41.220
lasts. Also, keep in mind that the timeline&nbsp;
is also not the same as the normal story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:46.620
since Luffy didn’t start his pirate journey&nbsp;
for another three years into the future.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:52.860
So let’s kick off this marine adventure where&nbsp;
every recruit begins life… as chore boys.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:58.800
Because unlike when Garp personally trained&nbsp;
Koby, I think Garp would be sick and tired&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:04.020
of these three troublemakers so they would&nbsp;
just be assigned to some random navy base and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:10.680
start at the very bottom of the marine ranks.&nbsp;
However, this probably won’t last long because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:16.980
these rambunctious kids are probably so awful at&nbsp;
chores that Garp would probably just throw them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:23.220
into battle since they aren’t good for anything&nbsp;
else. So it’s off to the ships to fight pirates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:27.600
in the East Blue. And I think they would stay&nbsp;
this way for several years, working their way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:32.520
up the ranks from Chore Boy to Seaman Recruits&nbsp;
because of their impressive fighting capabilities.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:38.160
One other major change is that Ace most&nbsp;
likely wouldn’t have his Fire devil fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:43.680
since he only found it after setting out&nbsp;
as a pirate. This means that Luffy is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:47.580
only one of the three with a devil&nbsp;
fruit. Not that it matters though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:52.560
because they are all insanely strong and&nbsp;
capable of taking out random pirates,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:57.240
though I do wonder if Ace would eventually&nbsp;
choose to use a sword or other bladed weapon.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:05.160
This simple life can’t continue forever though, so&nbsp;
let’s say that two years have passed. Ace and Sabo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:10.860
are now nineteen and they have been promoted to&nbsp;
Petty Officers, while Luffy at age sixteen remains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:17.160
a Seaman First Class. Now you might be wondering,&nbsp;
“Manu, Koby moved from a recruit to being a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:24.840
captain in that same amount of time, so shouldn’t&nbsp;
these three move up way faster?” Which is a fair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:30.720
point, but also remember that Koby had personal&nbsp;
training from Garp, so that along with Garp’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:36.900
recommendations probably moved him up the ranks a&nbsp;
bit faster than normal. Plus Oda probably had to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:42.900
somewhat keep pace with pirate Luffy’s warp speed&nbsp;
advancement, which isn’t the case in this scenario

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:49.380
That is all going to change very quickly though&nbsp;
because we have to remember that in any military&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:55.560
organization, you can’t stay with your friends&nbsp;
forever. So it is at this point the childhood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.560 --> 00:06:02.040
friends are split up. Sabo is sent to work with&nbsp;
the awful Captain Morgan at Shells Town, which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:06.780
is not going to turn out very well as we’ll see&nbsp;
in just a moment. Ace is assigned to Lieutenant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:12.180
Commander Fullbody. And Luffy is assigned to&nbsp;
Commodore Pudding Pudding. But even though the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:17.160
boys are separated, I can just imagine that they&nbsp;
would all still want to compete with each other to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:23.520
see who can get promoted the quickest. Especially&nbsp;
Luffy, since he is already behind the other two.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:27.180
Now, keep in mind that even though Sabo is&nbsp;
a marine, he would still have his strong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:31.560
sense of doing what is right, so when he&nbsp;
is put under the command of the abusive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:36.240
and - if we’re being honest - straight&nbsp;
up evil Captain Morgan I don’t think that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:40.440
Sabo would put up with it for long. And&nbsp;
while I’m not sure if this marine version&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:44.700
of Sabo would challenge Morgan to a&nbsp;
fight because of marine regulations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:50.340
I think he would definitely collect evidence and&nbsp;
submit a report to the marine higher ups. Then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:56.640
I could imagine Morgan finding out about it and&nbsp;
then trying to just kill Sabo on his own. Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:01.020
would be the perfect chance for Sabo to crush&nbsp;
Morgan and get him kicked out of the Marines.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:06.180
Then let’s shift over to Ace because if he is&nbsp;
working with Fullbody then they will probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:12.120
be dining at the floating restaurant Baratie&nbsp;
quite frequently. Which is perfect for Ace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:16.500
who can eat his fill during his visits here, I&nbsp;
think he would also have a chance to run into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:21.060
some pretty strong pirates who are coming for&nbsp;
the tasty grub. And even though it is still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:26.280
about a year before Don Krieg showed up in the&nbsp;
normal timeline, Ace can still gain a reputation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:32.520
as a defender of the floating restaurant. Which&nbsp;
would probably make him great friends with Sanji.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:37.740
However, while the older two are making names&nbsp;
for themselves, it is Luffy who truly makes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:43.380
first major splash as a marine. Because let’s say&nbsp;
another year has passed and now we are basically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:49.380
caught up to the timeline at the start of the&nbsp;
series. Luffy is still working for Pudding Pudding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:55.080
which eventually brings him to Arlong Park,&nbsp;
just like what happened in chapter 75. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.080 --> 00:08:02.760
while Arlong easily killed the marines then, this&nbsp;
time they have Luffy. And while it might be tough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:08.460
for Luffy to fight all of the Arlong pirates by&nbsp;
himself, we have to remember that he has already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:16.800
been out at sea for three years and should be much&nbsp;
stronger than he was when he started his journey.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:23.100
So in his heroic moment, Luffy wipes&nbsp;
out the Arlong pirates and saves Nami’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:27.300
village. Which means that he would likely&nbsp;
befriend the orange haired navigator,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:32.220
who would then likely join the marines since&nbsp;
her village is safe and her adopted mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:38.220
Bellemere was also a marine. So while we are&nbsp;
missing out on many of the other straw hats,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:42.360
at least Nami is joining&nbsp;
Luffy in the marine ranks.

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:48.780
Now these heroics get Luffy promoted up to&nbsp;
Ensign. But he’s not the only one because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:54.120
Ace and Sabo have also scored their&nbsp;
own impressive victories. For example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:59.460
Sabo and his new commander Ripper have gone&nbsp;
and rescued Orange Town from the invading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:04.800
Buggy Pirates. Ace also takes out Don Krieg&nbsp;
when the starving pirate tries to take over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:10.440
the Baratie. Unfortunately, no one is around&nbsp;
to save Usopp’s village, so sorry Usopp fans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:15.000
it looks like his tradition of&nbsp;
dying in these What Ifs continues.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:21.540
Which means that Ace and Sabo are joining Luffy in&nbsp;
the lowest rank of officer in the Marines. Oh boy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:27.180
let’s just hope they don’t actually get to give&nbsp;
orders to anyone. But with this promotion comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:31.920
new assignments. Ace and Luffy are both&nbsp;
placed under Captain Smoker in Loguetown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:36.960
while Sabo is assigned to Captain Hina, who&nbsp;
is already in the Grand Line.And even though&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:40.980
Smoker was originally happy to stay&nbsp;
at Loguetown in the original story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:45.120
I think that with his two newest Ensigns&nbsp;
constantly annoying him to go to the Grand Line,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:49.740
he would probably agree just so&nbsp;
those two would shut up about it.

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:56.220
And now that we are in the Grand Line, Ace, Sabo,&nbsp;
and Luffy are going to move through the ranks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.220 --> 00:10:02.880
very quickly. Though as we’ll see very soon, it's&nbsp;
not always in a positive direction. Because while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:07.440
they patrol the seas under their new captains,&nbsp;
I’d like to imagine that Luffy still runs into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:12.060
Vivi at some point. Maybe they come to Whiskey&nbsp;
Peak and meet her there, but however it happens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:16.800
Vivi would likely tell them all about her&nbsp;
country’s troubles after seeing how strong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:22.440
Luffy and Ace are. Of course, Luffy and Ace&nbsp;
want to go right away to take down the Sandman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:27.540
but Smoker says they cannot interfere with&nbsp;
a Warlord because they are basically immune&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:32.820
from the Marines. However, the captain does&nbsp;
agree to go to Alabasta, just to be around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:39.180
in case anything goes wrong. Sabo and Hina also&nbsp;
arrive, and as the civil war kicks into high gear,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:45.900
the three boys simply cannot sit around and let&nbsp;
all these innocent people die. So in their first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:52.500
major act of insubordination, Ace, Sabo, and&nbsp;
Luffy work together to take down Crocodile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:57.420
which they somehow manage to do,&nbsp;
even though he is a logia fruit user.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:02.340
Luffy might also meet Robin. And although&nbsp;
she wouldn’t let him become her friend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:06.255
Luffy would probably let her go.&nbsp;
He could even mention that if she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.255 --> 00:11:09.960
is looking for a crew to help her then&nbsp;
maybe she should try to find Shanks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:14.280
but we’ll see exactly how Robin’s&nbsp;
story goes later on in the video.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:21.420
However, this whole situation causes a huge&nbsp;
headache for the world government. And these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:26.520
three marines are headed for a ton of trouble&nbsp;
because even though the rulers of Alabasta&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:32.460
officially thank the three boys, they are still&nbsp;
demoted back down to Warrant Officers. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:36.120
at this point, the marine higher-ups&nbsp;
see great potential in the three boys,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:43.320
so I think it makes sense now if they were each&nbsp;
assigned to an admiral for special training. Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:49.020
is going to supercharge their advancements,&nbsp;
just like we saw when Garp trained Koby.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:53.820
They would likely pair up the two most&nbsp;
hot-headed, so Ace would go with Akainu.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:59.040
Luffy gets paired with Kizaru - by the way, I&nbsp;
would absolutely love to see how this training&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:03.420
would go since they are both pretty much&nbsp;
air-heads. And that leaves Sabo with Aokiji,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:07.980
which is also a VERY interesting&nbsp;
match because Aokiji, just like Sabo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:13.020
is starting to have some serious questions about&nbsp;
the corruption in the world government system.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:17.760
So this means they would definitely learn basic&nbsp;
haki. I also think Luffy would develop some of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:22.620
his Gear techniques, which all results in a&nbsp;
HUGE power boost for all three, especially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:28.080
because they now have the fundamental tools&nbsp;
to fight with any devil fruit user in the sea.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:32.340
So while those boys are getting their own&nbsp;
personal training arc, let’s shift to other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:36.900
events going on in the world. Because even&nbsp;
with Ace, Sabo, and Luffy all in the Marines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:42.660
I still think that Blackbeard would be able to&nbsp;
backstab this guy and steal his Darkness Logia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:48.240
fruit. From here he would still have his same plan&nbsp;
to become a warlord. However, instead of being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:53.760
able to capture Luffy as was his original plan, or&nbsp;
take out Ace when he came for revenge, Blackbeard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:58.560
will have to find some other way to convince&nbsp;
the World Government to make him a Warlord.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.460
However, to keep things fairly similar to the&nbsp;
original events, let’s assume that he still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:07.500
targets members of the Whitebeard pirates. Maybe&nbsp;
he takes out some of the lower ranking commanders,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:11.640
and this increased level of aggression&nbsp;
could see someone like Marco the Phoenix&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:17.160
come after Blackbeard. And if Blackbeard could&nbsp;
capture him and hand him over to the Marines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:22.920
then we have all the ingredients we need&nbsp;
for Marineford. Although I certainly think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:27.240
Blackbeard would have a harder time sneaking&nbsp;
into Impel Down to break out the level six&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:32.400
prisoners since Luffy isn’t there to cause the&nbsp;
massive prison break. The darkness fruit user&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:36.000
might be able to come up with some other&nbsp;
plan though, such as the hypnosis user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.540
Laffitte, somehow sneaking in and&nbsp;
causing their own prison break.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:45.180
Anyway, with Marco taking Ace’s place on&nbsp;
the execution stand, Whitebeard would still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:50.820
likely come to try to rescue his right hand&nbsp;
man, which perfectly sets the stage for Ace,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:57.240
Sabo, and Luffy to demonstrate their new powers&nbsp;
in a war that unfolds much differently than the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:57.240 --> 00:14:01.980
original story. Because we have to keep in&nbsp;
mind that Marco was a key fighter for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:07.860
Whitebeard pirates during the war. He even took&nbsp;
on admirals, so with him on the execution stand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:13.980
that is a massive loss for the pirates. Plus&nbsp;
no Impel Down prisoners to help the pirates.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:19.860
And while I don’t think Ace, Sabo, and Luffy&nbsp;
are ready to take on Whitebeard yet, I do think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:25.980
they would do well against the Whitebeard&nbsp;
commanders such as Jozu, Vista, and Izou.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:31.320
Which all results in the Marines winning this&nbsp;
fight much easier than in the original story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:36.720
Marco gets executed. Which honestly&nbsp;
pains me to say since he is one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:39.780
my all-time favorite characters.&nbsp;
Whitebeard’s defeat doesn’t change,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:43.860
which allows Blackbeard to swoop in and&nbsp;
steal his devil fruit. Although it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:48.060
possible that the Marines may be able to&nbsp;
keep Blackbeard away, I believe this was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:48.060 --> 00:14:53.580
Blackbeard’s ultimate goal all along, so I think&nbsp;
he would somehow figure out a way to get it done.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:15:00.660
Which means this is where things turn&nbsp;
dark. Because with Whitebeard dead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:05.700
I think Akainu and other marines would continue&nbsp;
to fight against the remaining pirates,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:11.280
causing way more bloodshed than in the&nbsp;
original war. This is particularly hard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:16.320
to take for someone like Sabo, and Luffy&nbsp;
would also probably hate to see lives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:22.800
needlessly wasted. Which means that everyone is&nbsp;
relieved when Shanks shows up to stop the war.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:29.580
But this might not actually be as good for Luffy&nbsp;
as you might think. Because remember that Shanks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:35.520
trusted Luffy with his legendary straw hat because&nbsp;
he assumed that Luffy would become a pirate, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:40.860
he likely even knew that Luffy had the potential&nbsp;
to become Joy Boy. So now that Luffy is clearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:48.420
established as a marine, we have to ask what would&nbsp;
Shanks do? Well, I think the most likely thing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:54.600
after he stops the fighting is that he gives Luffy&nbsp;
a warning. He would say something along the lines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:54.600 --> 00:16:00.060
of “That hat belongs in the hands of the future&nbsp;
pirate king” and he might demand that Luffy leave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:06.600
the Marines or give up the hat. Which brings up&nbsp;
an interesting dilemma for Luffy. He was inspired&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:12.060
by Shanks as a kid, but eventually decided to&nbsp;
become a marine after seeing evil pirates attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:17.820
his village. So while I’m sure he still feels&nbsp;
some call to adventure, in this scenario he will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:23.820
reject Shanks’ warning and stay a marine. Which&nbsp;
leaves Shanks with two options. Try to eventually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:29.880
convince Luffy to become a pirate, or kill him&nbsp;
so that his devil fruit can be reincarnated.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:35.880
However, I just can’t see Shanks taking&nbsp;
out Luffy here, especially after he just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:41.040
stopped the fighting, so for now he zips in,&nbsp;
steals the straw hat back, and then leaves.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:47.280
Which would still leave Luffy furious, but he&nbsp;
would probably be held back by Sabo and Ace.

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:52.980
Now with Marineford over, Whitebeard is dead and&nbsp;
his crew is shattered. Blackbeard is basically a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:58.260
Yonko at this point. And Ace, Sabo, and Luffy&nbsp;
are all promoted to Captain based on their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:03.180
feats during the war. This promotion grants&nbsp;
them a bit more freedom with their own ships&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:07.440
and crews. And the first thing they do with&nbsp;
that freedom is subscribe to this channel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.980
which you can do too by pressing&nbsp;
that shiny red subscribe button.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:17.194
However, there are even more changes coming to the&nbsp;
world. Because even though there wouldn’t be a two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:17.194 --> 00:17:23.460
year time skip, Akainu and Aokiji would still have&nbsp;
their legendary duel. Aokiji would of course lose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:30.240
and leave the Marines, which is a major blow to&nbsp;
all three of the boys since Aokiji saved Ace and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:37.620
Luffy back at the start of this What If, and the&nbsp;
icy admiral was the one who trained Sabo. So hmm,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:42.780
wonder if we’ll see him later. That of course&nbsp;
means we have some new admirals to pick,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:47.580
and while Luffy immediately volunteers,&nbsp;
he is passed over. But don’t worry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:52.680
just wait until you see the truly epic battle&nbsp;
that earns him this promotion later on.

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:58.620
This takes the boys into the New World, where&nbsp;
they really start to shine. Over the two years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:04.020
they battle countless strong pirates, growing&nbsp;
stronger and developing their haki. Luffy and Ace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:09.240
might also unlock their conqueror’s haki at some&nbsp;
point, though it has never been confirmed if Sabo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:15.240
has this ability. They might also become friends&nbsp;
with Zoro, who in this timeline has become an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:20.280
strong bounty hunter - funny we haven’t seen&nbsp;
one of those before – and between Zoro and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:24.480
the three young Captains, they make something&nbsp;
of a competition out of taking down members&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:28.980
of the worst generation like Captain Kid, who&nbsp;
is particularly ruthless, the straw man Basil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:34.020
Hawkins, and even perhaps Jewelry Bonney, who&nbsp;
the marines were extra focused on recapturing.

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:39.720
And all these feats eventually see them&nbsp;
rise to the rank of Vice-Admirals. Not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:45.480
bad for a bunch of kids, but just&nbsp;
wait until you see what comes next.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:50.160
I think Luffy might also meet Rayleigh&nbsp;
at some point, and just like Shanks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:54.240
I think the former right hand of the&nbsp;
pirate king would try to convince Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:54.240 --> 00:19:00.360
to become a pirate. Which might actually be&nbsp;
starting to look more attractive to Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:05.520
especially as he sees more of the corruption of&nbsp;
the world government. For example, he might want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:11.940
to take a more active role in taking down the&nbsp;
Yonko, but the marine leadership won’t let him.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:17.760
However, Luffy says orders be damned because when&nbsp;
he, Ace, and Sabo join Fujitora in Dressrosa and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:21.840
they see all of the horrible things that&nbsp;
Doflamingo has done, I can’t see anyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:27.900
stopping them from taking down the corrupt&nbsp;
Warlord. And while this saves the kingdom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:32.820
their actions draw the wrath of the fleet&nbsp;
admiral Akainu, just like Fujitora did in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:36.836
the original story, which gets them&nbsp;
banned from all marine bases for now.

00:19:36.836 --> 00:19:42.720
But that doesn’t bother them, and I think around&nbsp;
this time they would also reunite with the former&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:47.940
admiral Kuzan, who tells them a bit about why he&nbsp;
left and what he is planning to do in the future.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:54.540
At this point, Luffy and Sabo are tempted to join&nbsp;
him, especially Sabo, but Ace convinces them to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:59.040
stay and remain loyal to the marines because&nbsp;
Ace in particular doesn’t want to leave the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:03.840
relationships he has developed with many of his&nbsp;
comrades in the marines. However, the more time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:09.900
Luffy spends in the New World, the more tempting&nbsp;
it becomes to try to learn about the One Piece.

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:14.100
Which means that when Kuzan leaves them with&nbsp;
one other very important piece of information&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:19.380
they immediately set off on their most&nbsp;
important mission yet. Apparently,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:23.880
Kuzan has met with Nico Robin and she has been&nbsp;
secretly going around collecting information&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:29.520
on the poneglyphs. Kuzan tells them where she&nbsp;
is and that she would like to see Luffy again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:34.380
because she has some information to tell&nbsp;
him. So Luffy, Ace, and Sabo go to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:42.660
with Robin. And this single event is going to&nbsp;
have major consequences for the entire world.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:47.940
Because when the boys meet with Robin on some&nbsp;
random island, they are met with a shocking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:53.460
surprise. Blackbeard and his crew have also&nbsp;
arrived and are ransacking the entire island&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:58.380
trying to find Robin. This instantly puts&nbsp;
Luffy, Sabo, and Ace into battle mode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:03.060
and they square off against the Blackbeard&nbsp;
Pirates. But with just the three of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:08.100
against the Yonko crew, they would probably&nbsp;
have a very hard time coming out on top.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:13.260
However, this is just the start of this clash&nbsp;
because Kuzan, who at this point has rejected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:18.060
Blackbeard’s invitation, shows up to help the&nbsp;
three marines. And he’s not alone. Because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:22.500
even though he left the Marines, he still wants&nbsp;
to bring peace to the world, which led him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:27.900
warn the Marines that something might happen on&nbsp;
this island. So not only does Kuzan arrive, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:34.140
also the three admirals - Kizaru, Greenbull, and&nbsp;
Fujitora - show up to stamp out the Yonko threat.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:42.000
Which definitely turns the battle in the Marines&nbsp;
favor. That is until another major player joins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:47.040
the conflict. You see, ever since Luffy, Ace,&nbsp;
and Sabo took out Doflamingo, the Yonko Kaido&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:52.260
has been out for their blood because they ruined&nbsp;
his artificial devil fruit production. And let’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:59.220
say he somehow follows them to this island and&nbsp;
joins the insane battle. Which at this point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:05.220
this island is probably going to be destroyed,&nbsp;
but the end of the battle brings some hope for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:10.440
the future. Because I think the three admirals&nbsp;
would be able to combine to take out Kaido,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:15.540
but not without suffering casualties. Plus&nbsp;
Blackbeard is known for backstabbing, so I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:20.220
think it is fair to say that even though Kaido&nbsp;
gets taken out, all three admirals are killed.

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:25.680
But of course that leaves our three young&nbsp;
heroes, who would surely awaken some of their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:29.880
advanced levels of haki. Although I’m not sure&nbsp;
if Luffy would ever unlock Gear 5 as a marine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:35.220
but at this point I think they are admiral level&nbsp;
fighters on their own, so their combined strength,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:35.220 --> 00:22:40.620
plus the help of Kuzan should be enough to&nbsp;
eventually defeat Blackbeard and end the conflict.

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:47.880
Which would certainly throw the world into chaos.&nbsp;
Two Emperors defeated. Three admirals killed. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:53.100
entire world would be in shock. However, I&nbsp;
think the Marines would wisely promote Ace,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:58.140
Sabo, and Luffy to admirals right away since&nbsp;
they are now basically the strongest marines.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:58.800 --> 00:23:02.220
And even though these three might be tired&nbsp;
of the corruption in the World Government,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:02.220 --> 00:23:08.460
at least as admirals they might be able to&nbsp;
have some influence on the marines. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:12.720
also probably means that Ace and Sabo get to pick&nbsp;
from the World Government’s stock of devil fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:16.740
although we don’t know exactly how&nbsp;
that process works. Regardless they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:20.940
would probably grow even stronger&nbsp;
with new overpowered devil fruits

00:23:20.940 --> 00:23:26.280
But now with the world in chaos, the race to find&nbsp;
the One Piece heats up even more. And as Luffy is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:31.500
out fighting the flood of pirates seeking the&nbsp;
treasure, he is met by none other than Red-Hair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:37.740
Shanks, who has come with another challenge. If&nbsp;
Luffy can defeat Shanks, then the Red-Hair captain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:42.480
will leave him alone for good. But if Shanks&nbsp;
wins, then Luffy must leave the Marines and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:47.700
chase after the One Piece because Shanks believes&nbsp;
it is his destiny. And if you want to see exactly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:47.700 --> 00:23:52.920
how this legendary battle between Luffy and Shanks&nbsp;
could go, you can watch this video right here.

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:56.100
Shanks for watching, and&nbsp;
I’ll see you in the next one.

